<title>USA: Authentic Fitness in buyback up to $10 mln.</title>
<headline>Authentic Fitness in buyback up to $10 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES, Calif. 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Authentic Fitness Corp said on Friday it will repurchase up to $10 million worth of its common shares on the open market.</p>
<p>Authentic Fitness shares were up 1/2 to 14-1/2 in mid-afternoon trading.</p>
<p>The company makes swimwear and accessories and fitness apparel.</p>
</text>
